			],
			"Message": "docs(Output): Update product directory references from .land to .fiddee\n\nRename all documentation comments and inline `Why` strings across the Output pipeline, plugin index, extension gallery service, and icon stylesheet URL rewriter to reference the new `~/.fiddee/extensions/` path instead of `~/.land/extensions/`.\n\nThis is a pure documentation string update — no functional changes. The affected files:\n\n- Source/Apply/Pipeline.ts — ServiceCopies Why comment\n- Source/Plugin/Index.ts — BuildPipeline LAND-PATCH comment\n- Source/Plugin/Transform/Replace/Extension/Gallery/Service.ts — module-level doc comment\n- Source/Plugin/Transform/Rewrite/Icons/Style/Sheet/URLs.ts — multiple doc comments and AnchorSpec rationale\n- Source/Service/CEL/Null/Extension/Gallery/Service.ts — module-level doc comment\n- Compiled JavaScript bundles and source maps regenerated to match.",
